n Majorana fermion modes (equivalently, n Dirac fermion modes) governed by \
the non-Hermitian Hamiltonian consisting of the coherent and damping parts \
specified by 2 n*2 n real anti-symmetric matrices ham and dmp, respectively, \
plus additional constant damping gmm.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, 
